OL,3,AHome secretary setting out changes to
OL,4,Asettlement rules for legal migrants -
OL,5,Awatch live
OL,6,
OL,7,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood is
OL,8,Fgiving a statement in the House of
OL,9,FCommons, in which she's expected to
OL,10,Faddress the government's next steps on
OL,11,Findefinite leave to remain - watch live
OL,12,Fabove
OL,14,FMahmood previously proposed extending
OL,15,Fthe wait from the current five years to
OL,16,F10, in response to a period of high net
OL,17,Fmigration, but has faced opposition
OL,18,Ffrom within her own party for proposing
OL,19,Fto apply the changes to migrant workers
OL,20,Falready in the UK
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/41
