OL,3,ALindsay Clancy back in US court facing
OL,4,Apossible retrial for deaths of her
OL,5,Athree children
OL,6,
OL,7,FProsecutors are considering whether to
OL,8,Fseek a new trial - and they could put
OL,9,Fforward a date for that on Monday
OL,11,FThere have been tense moments as the
OL,12,Fdefence team questions how the judge
OL,13,Fhandled the single holdout juror and
OL,14,Fthe judge has threatened to stop the
OL,15,Fhearing
OL,17,FClancy, 36, pleaded not guilty to
OL,18,Fmurdering Cora, 5, Dawson, 3, and
OL,19,FCallan, eight months, arguing she had
OL,20,Fpostpartum psychosis
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/41
